   "number": "81",
   "text": "[Repealed 2004-31-81 (3).] Consequential Amendments [Note: See Table of Legislative Changes for the status of sections 82 to 103.] Section(s) Affected Act 82 Environmental Management Act 83-86 Forest Act 87-96 Forest and Range Practices Act 97-98 Forest Practices Code of British Columbia Act 99 Hydro and Power Authority Act 100 Park Act 101 Special Accounts Appropriation and Control Act 102 Waste Management Act 103 Wildfire Act",
   "part": "Part 8",
   "heading": "Repealed"
  },
